WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:01.333
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:02.363
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

00:00:02.363 --> 00:00:03.373
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.933
(Danger: Fall Hazard)

00:00:09.363 --> 00:00:11.403
(Samcheon Cement)

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:27.133
(Danger: Fall Hazard)

00:00:27.963 --> 00:00:29.163
Watch out.

00:00:29.703 --> 00:00:30.803
(Samcheon Cement)

00:00:42.803 --> 00:00:44.863
(Episode 4)

00:00:48.603 --> 00:00:49.733
You bastard.

00:00:50.363 --> 00:00:51.863
Do you have any idea what that money was for?

00:00:52.533 --> 00:00:53.533
Darn it.

00:00:54.103 --> 00:00:55.833
Sir.

00:00:56.533 --> 00:00:58.233
Without that money, my family of six...

00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:00.533
Will be out on the street.

00:01:01.163 --> 00:01:02.633
Please, the money you scammed from me...

00:01:02.863 --> 00:01:04.403
Please give it back, sir.

00:01:05.363 --> 00:01:07.403
Scam? Who scammed who, you punk?

00:01:12.703 --> 00:01:13.703
Hey.

00:01:14.263 --> 00:01:15.263
Scam?

00:01:16.003 --> 00:01:17.003
Scam?

00:01:17.063 --> 00:01:18.263
Help me.

00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:22.463
Help me.

00:01:22.463 --> 00:01:23.863
Kim Mu Jin, wake up.

00:01:23.863 --> 00:01:25.063
Kim Mu Jin.

00:01:25.303 --> 00:01:26.833
Kim Mu Jin, please wake up.

00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:30.763
(Paramedics)

00:01:30.963 --> 00:01:32.403
Where did he get hurt?

00:01:32.403 --> 00:01:33.463
How?

00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:35.803
How badly is he hurt?

00:01:35.863 --> 00:01:36.933
(Chairman Hong OK Seon)

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:38.903
What on earth happened?

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:44.863
It's not life-threatening, is it?

00:01:45.463 --> 00:01:46.533
Right?

00:01:53.663 --> 00:01:55.663
(Yeoltan Pork Belly)

00:02:04.063 --> 00:02:05.603
(Dad)

00:02:17.533 --> 00:02:18.933
(Dad)

00:02:19.733 --> 00:02:22.403
- Dad, I'll call you back in a... - Gyu Rim.

00:02:24.063 --> 00:02:25.103
Dad.

00:02:26.933 --> 00:02:28.663
By any chance, do you have some money?

00:02:31.663 --> 00:02:33.603
(Surgery In Progress)

00:02:38.863 --> 00:02:40.233
(Surgery In Progress)

00:02:40.303 --> 00:02:42.963
(Operating Room)

00:02:48.603 --> 00:02:49.603
Hello.

00:02:50.263 --> 00:02:51.263
Yoon Jin.

00:03:06.733 --> 00:03:09.603
What happened? What happened to your face, Dad?

00:03:10.933 --> 00:03:12.533
We lost our house.

00:03:13.233 --> 00:03:14.233
What do you mean?

00:03:14.303 --> 00:03:16.203
We're about to be thrown out on the street.

00:03:16.603 --> 00:03:18.203
What are you talking about?

00:03:18.333 --> 00:03:19.333
Well...

00:03:21.863 --> 00:03:23.033
What are these?

00:03:24.433 --> 00:03:25.703
Overdue notices, collection letters,

00:03:25.763 --> 00:03:27.163
A foreclosure and an eviction notice.

00:03:28.463 --> 00:03:30.863
You never came home, but you sure managed to hide these.

00:03:31.563 --> 00:03:33.563
I knew you'd all freak out if you knew,

00:03:34.263 --> 00:03:36.163
So I had someone else take care of them.

00:03:49.703 --> 00:03:51.903
You took out a loan against this house?

00:03:52.533 --> 00:03:55.403
Well, I was going to pay it all back,

00:03:55.963 --> 00:03:57.833
But some bastards scammed me.

00:03:58.063 --> 00:04:00.103
I lost sleep trying to get that money back.

00:04:00.463 --> 00:04:01.703
I even did a stakeout.

00:04:02.503 --> 00:04:04.363
I'm lucky to be alive.

00:04:04.663 --> 00:04:07.533
Turns out those bastards were gangsters.

00:04:07.703 --> 00:04:09.103
They're really nasty,

00:04:10.163 --> 00:04:11.603
And absolutely terrifying.

00:04:13.933 --> 00:04:14.963
By any chance,

00:04:15.863 --> 00:04:17.933
Do you guys have any money?

00:04:19.033 --> 00:04:21.563
Just enough for a security deposit on a monthly rental.

00:04:22.133 --> 00:04:23.863
For the six of us to move out right away,

00:04:23.933 --> 00:04:26.033
We need at least two rooms, for the men and women,

00:04:26.363 --> 00:04:27.763
And one bathroom.

00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:29.503
Let's just all fend for ourselves.

00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:33.003
It's not like we've ever been that close anyway.

00:04:33.173 --> 00:04:34.803
Dad can go his way, Han Gyu Rim can go hers,

00:04:34.863 --> 00:04:35.863
And I'll go mine.

00:04:35.933 --> 00:04:37.363
Gyu Oh is old enough to be on his own.

00:04:37.463 --> 00:04:39.763
So let's all split up and take care of ourselves.

00:04:39.863 --> 00:04:43.463
Then what about Gyu Min and Gyu Seo? What about the twins?

00:04:44.933 --> 00:04:47.103
Since when have you cared so much about them?

00:04:47.463 --> 00:04:49.673
After their mom ran off when they were three,

00:04:49.803 --> 00:04:52.603
You left them with Han Gyu Rim and washed your hands of them.

00:04:54.173 --> 00:04:55.173
Stop it.

00:04:55.703 --> 00:04:57.503
Why? Am I lying?

00:04:58.003 --> 00:04:59.173
You need to snap out of it too.

00:04:59.233 --> 00:05:01.563
Raising them for ten years is more than enough.

00:05:02.133 --> 00:05:04.633
I'm telling you, just drop them off at an orphanage already.

00:05:05.903 --> 00:05:07.233
Will you shut your mouth, Han Gyu Young?

00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:10.103
Leave the kids out of this,

00:05:10.433 --> 00:05:12.173
And if you want to leave, then you leave.

00:05:12.733 --> 00:05:16.803
Fine, I'll be the one to leave. I'm leaving this miserable house.

00:05:18.673 --> 00:05:21.563
That girl has such a temper.

00:05:22.233 --> 00:05:24.403
I wonder who she takes after.

00:05:25.633 --> 00:05:27.633
But you're just like me, Gyu Rim.

00:05:30.933 --> 00:05:33.633
When do we have to be out of this house?

00:05:35.733 --> 00:05:36.733
Soon.

00:05:37.633 --> 00:05:38.633
Immediately.

00:05:41.533 --> 00:05:42.533
Well...

00:05:43.203 --> 00:05:44.803
Do you really not have any money?

00:05:45.133 --> 00:05:48.803
You really don't have anything stashed away?

00:05:49.333 --> 00:05:52.033
- I'll pay you back with interest. - I'll see what I can do.

00:05:52.103 --> 00:05:53.103
Wait.

00:05:54.263 --> 00:05:55.263
Gyu Rim.

00:05:55.363 --> 00:05:58.133
You truly are the eldest daughter of this family.

00:05:58.463 --> 00:05:59.463
You know...

00:06:00.163 --> 00:06:02.233
You're my lifeline, right?

00:06:08.963 --> 00:06:10.603
Gosh, seriously...

00:06:30.033 --> 00:06:31.103
I'm leaving.

00:06:31.233 --> 00:06:33.563
You all have a nice, happy life together.

00:06:44.863 --> 00:06:47.363
(Jung Woo)

00:06:48.533 --> 00:06:49.533
Hello?

00:06:59.563 --> 00:07:01.763
- Gyu Rim. - Jung Woo.

00:07:03.033 --> 00:07:05.633
The surgery went well, and they moved him...

00:07:05.633 --> 00:07:07.063
To his room a little while ago.

00:07:08.003 --> 00:07:09.633
Why was Mu Jin at a construction site?

00:07:09.803 --> 00:07:11.063
Oh, well...

00:07:12.063 --> 00:07:15.403
He was worried about you, so he told me not to say anything.

00:07:15.703 --> 00:07:17.003
Mu Jin...

00:07:18.963 --> 00:07:20.433
Got kicked out of his house,

00:07:21.063 --> 00:07:23.333
So he was working a part-time job at a construction site.

00:07:55.663 --> 00:07:56.963
You must be Han Gyu Rim.

00:08:04.733 --> 00:08:06.203
I'm Mu Jin's older sister.

00:08:08.163 --> 00:08:09.303
You didn't know...

00:08:09.563 --> 00:08:11.833
He was working at a construction site?

00:08:13.233 --> 00:08:15.663
He's never lifted a single brick in his life.

00:08:16.333 --> 00:08:18.433
He must have reeked of pain relief patches,

00:08:19.533 --> 00:08:21.263
And you didn't notice a thing?

00:08:22.633 --> 00:08:24.433
- Should we sit here? - Sure.

00:08:32.663 --> 00:08:34.233
What's that pain patch smell?

00:08:34.603 --> 00:08:35.603
What?

00:08:37.803 --> 00:08:40.603
I hurt myself a little working out at the gym earlier.

00:08:40.663 --> 00:08:44.633
You should be more careful. Let me see.

00:08:45.503 --> 00:08:46.503
See what?

00:08:46.563 --> 00:08:48.563
- Come on, let me see. - No, I'm fine.

00:08:49.563 --> 00:08:51.803
- Is it bad? - No, I'm okay.

00:08:56.463 --> 00:08:57.633
And you didn't know he left home...

00:08:57.703 --> 00:08:59.203
And was living in a tiny studio, did you?

00:08:59.833 --> 00:09:01.633
What do you even know about Mu Jin?

00:09:02.273 --> 00:09:05.463
He gave up everything for you.

00:09:07.303 --> 00:09:08.833
Let Mu Jin go.

00:09:09.733 --> 00:09:11.633
He is not someone...

00:09:12.663 --> 00:09:14.463
You can handle.

00:09:17.163 --> 00:09:18.333
Please.

00:09:18.863 --> 00:09:20.133
Han Gyu Rim.

00:09:39.663 --> 00:09:40.863
Sweetie.

00:09:41.133 --> 00:09:42.703
Stop crying.

00:09:43.003 --> 00:09:45.033
They said the surgery was a success, okay?

00:09:45.933 --> 00:09:47.933
It's my fault.

00:09:49.133 --> 00:09:50.503
I hated him so much...

00:09:50.563 --> 00:09:54.333
I wished he'd just break his leg. That's why...

00:09:54.633 --> 00:09:56.773
Oh, sweetie, it's not your fault.

00:09:57.063 --> 00:09:59.703
I'm telling you, it's not because of you.

00:09:59.963 --> 00:10:01.633
He'll wake up soon, right?

00:10:02.163 --> 00:10:03.773
He's going to be okay, right?

00:10:04.203 --> 00:10:05.563
Of course.

00:10:12.163 --> 00:10:14.303
Oh dear, you're going to collapse at this rate.

00:10:14.403 --> 00:10:17.663
Aren't you dizzy? Do you want some water?

00:10:18.403 --> 00:10:21.963
Oh my gosh. You must be so shocked.

00:10:56.203 --> 00:10:57.603
You must live in this neighbourhood.

00:10:57.603 --> 00:10:58.603
No.

00:10:58.703 --> 00:11:00.103
I mean, yes.

00:11:02.403 --> 00:11:04.433
People are going to think we're a real couple.

00:11:04.663 --> 00:11:05.763
It seems so.

00:11:07.303 --> 00:11:08.433
Right now,

00:11:09.533 --> 00:11:11.103
I'm confessing to you.

00:11:11.103 --> 00:11:13.703
Asking you to look at me, and only me.

00:11:13.803 --> 00:11:15.863
I'm saying I think I like you, Gyu Rim.

00:11:16.603 --> 00:11:19.333
If I don't confess my feelings to you right now,

00:11:20.263 --> 00:11:21.833
I really feel like I'll lose you,

00:11:21.833 --> 00:11:24.933
And my heart is pounding like crazy.

00:11:25.263 --> 00:11:27.033
I really had to work up the courage for this.

00:11:27.763 --> 00:11:29.463
You just keep letting your heart flutter for me.

00:11:30.033 --> 00:11:31.363
You don't have to show it.

00:11:33.433 --> 00:11:34.703
But it'd be even better if you did.

00:11:35.463 --> 00:11:37.003
Whether it's a mess or not,

00:11:37.663 --> 00:11:39.963
I'll go anywhere as long as I'm with you, Gyu Rim.

00:11:40.563 --> 00:11:42.133
So don't you run away either.

00:11:42.533 --> 00:11:43.733
Gyu Rim, could I...

00:11:44.663 --> 00:11:46.063
Hug you?

00:11:46.063 --> 00:11:48.333
Break up? Why would we break up?

00:11:48.403 --> 00:11:50.433
That will never happen as long as you don't leave me.

00:11:50.503 --> 00:11:53.263
I was worried all day that you were going to break up with me.

00:11:53.363 --> 00:11:55.603
Do you know how scared I was?

00:12:49.063 --> 00:12:50.933
(Seized Item)

00:12:54.933 --> 00:12:56.503
You can't take that off.

00:12:59.763 --> 00:13:01.463
What is this?

00:13:01.533 --> 00:13:03.833
They put that there to show it's not ours anymore.

00:13:03.903 --> 00:13:06.803
There are stickers on my bed and desk too.

00:13:07.703 --> 00:13:11.233
Gyu Seo, I'll buy you a new bed and desk soon.

00:13:15.663 --> 00:13:17.003
(Seized Item)

00:13:46.933 --> 00:13:48.333
Hello, this is Han Gyu Rim.

00:13:51.763 --> 00:13:53.063
Just give me 100,000 dollars.

00:13:59.303 --> 00:14:00.633
100,000 dollars?

00:14:00.863 --> 00:14:03.333
100,000 dollars for leaving Mu Jin.

00:14:03.563 --> 00:14:05.363
That sounds like a pretty good deal, don't you think?

00:14:06.933 --> 00:14:08.633
A deal?

00:14:08.703 --> 00:14:10.133
To be honest,

00:14:10.563 --> 00:14:12.763
When I heard Mu Jin was from a rich family,

00:14:13.203 --> 00:14:15.933
I was surprised, but a part of me was thrilled.

00:14:17.533 --> 00:14:18.903
I thought, "Am I going to be a Cinderella,"

00:14:18.903 --> 00:14:20.303
"just like in the movies?"

00:14:21.103 --> 00:14:24.103
"I won't have to struggle through this miserable life anymore."

00:14:25.003 --> 00:14:26.963
I was so happy. Truly.

00:14:28.903 --> 00:14:30.333
But then he was kicked out of his house...

00:14:30.403 --> 00:14:32.633
And got hurt working at a construction site.

00:14:32.863 --> 00:14:34.663
This isn't right.

00:14:35.533 --> 00:14:37.203
This isn't how things should be.

00:14:37.263 --> 00:14:40.703
The more I thought about it, the more unsettling it was.

00:14:40.763 --> 00:14:42.333
You just saw him fighting for his life.

00:14:42.333 --> 00:14:43.733
How can you say that?

00:14:44.263 --> 00:14:45.933
Who do you think is the reason he's like that?

00:14:46.063 --> 00:14:48.833
For whom did my Mu Jin give up everything and leave home?

00:14:48.833 --> 00:14:51.363
I never told him to give everything up.

00:14:53.363 --> 00:14:55.403
Didn't you love my Mu Jin?

00:14:55.533 --> 00:14:56.903
I did.

00:14:57.963 --> 00:14:59.363
I loved him, but...

00:14:59.863 --> 00:15:01.303
I mean, it would be one thing if I hadn't known,

00:15:01.303 --> 00:15:03.503
But I knew exactly what family he came from.

00:15:03.933 --> 00:15:05.603
A penniless day labourer like Kim Mu Jin.

00:15:05.603 --> 00:15:07.563
What's so appealing about that to me now?

00:15:07.633 --> 00:15:10.633
- Do you think you can say anything? - If things stay as they are,

00:15:11.033 --> 00:15:13.403
I'd have to take on all of Kim Mu Jin's burdens...

00:15:13.463 --> 00:15:14.763
Without any help from you.

00:15:15.203 --> 00:15:17.103
Honestly, I'm not confident I can do that.

00:15:17.963 --> 00:15:19.763
We only dated for one year.

00:15:20.203 --> 00:15:21.903
And we're not married.

00:15:22.303 --> 00:15:24.533
I'm having a hard enough time as it is.

00:15:25.333 --> 00:15:26.333
How am I supposed to know...

00:15:26.403 --> 00:15:27.603
How bad his disability from the crash will be?

00:15:27.663 --> 00:15:29.133
Why would I just take on all of that?

00:15:29.733 --> 00:15:32.103
I can't do it. I don't want to.

00:15:32.403 --> 00:15:33.433
Are you...

00:15:34.103 --> 00:15:35.133
Even human?

00:15:35.363 --> 00:15:36.403
Are you?

00:15:39.333 --> 00:15:41.733
Because of a pathetic girl like you, my Mu Jin...

00:15:50.163 --> 00:15:52.533
I don't want to waste another word on a snob like you,

00:15:52.603 --> 00:15:53.703
So don't ever contact us again.

00:16:00.903 --> 00:16:01.903
What is this?

00:16:02.233 --> 00:16:03.233
It's a voice recorder.

00:16:04.663 --> 00:16:05.863
When Mu Jin wakes up,

00:16:07.663 --> 00:16:08.733
Please play this for him.

00:16:10.663 --> 00:16:11.703
Mu Jin...

00:16:12.233 --> 00:16:14.133
Is not the kind of person who gives up on me easily.

00:16:15.663 --> 00:16:17.963
This is what it would take for him to finally give up on me.

00:16:18.903 --> 00:16:21.363
So you planned this from the start...

00:16:24.763 --> 00:16:27.633
I'm sorry to have caused you this unnecessary worry.

00:16:29.303 --> 00:16:30.333
The 100,000 dollars...

00:16:31.233 --> 00:16:32.403
Do you still need the money?

00:16:34.433 --> 00:16:35.503
I don't need it.

00:16:47.703 --> 00:16:49.503
Are you okay?

00:16:49.963 --> 00:16:52.663
The doctor said everything's normal except for the fracture.

00:16:52.863 --> 00:16:54.103
You don't have to worry too much.

00:16:57.363 --> 00:16:58.503
Give me my phone.

00:16:58.973 --> 00:17:00.563
It's not here.

00:17:01.203 --> 00:17:02.203
Do you think you lost it?

00:17:05.403 --> 00:17:06.503
What happened?

00:17:08.363 --> 00:17:09.663
How long has it been since I got hurt?

00:17:10.133 --> 00:17:11.133
Three days.

00:17:13.233 --> 00:17:14.233
Gyu Rim...

00:17:15.103 --> 00:17:16.403
Gyu Rim must be so worried.

00:17:17.703 --> 00:17:19.803
Gyu Rim already came by.

00:17:21.103 --> 00:17:22.133
Did you tell her everything?

00:17:23.763 --> 00:17:25.433
Did you tell her I was hurt at a construction site?

00:17:25.903 --> 00:17:28.603
No, I just said you were walking,

00:17:29.803 --> 00:17:32.233
And got struck by lightning out of the blue.

00:17:35.263 --> 00:17:36.263
No...

00:17:36.903 --> 00:17:38.803
I just told her I wasn't sure what happened.

00:17:38.863 --> 00:17:40.403
And that I rushed over as soon as I got the call.

00:17:42.263 --> 00:17:44.103
If you tell her the truth, you're dead.

00:17:45.333 --> 00:17:47.733
Well, I'm dead either way.

00:17:48.433 --> 00:17:50.163
- What? - It's nothing.

00:17:52.233 --> 00:17:53.473
Gyu Rim is really worried, right?

00:17:57.303 --> 00:17:58.303
Well...

00:17:59.503 --> 00:18:01.433
She came the first day but hasn't been back since.

00:18:01.703 --> 00:18:04.133
She hasn't even called to ask how you're doing.

00:18:09.063 --> 00:18:10.233
What are you doing? Are you trying to go see her...

00:18:10.233 --> 00:18:11.263
In your condition?

00:18:12.433 --> 00:18:15.133
- Call Gyu Rim for me. - Oh, honestly.

00:18:22.633 --> 00:18:23.633
The number you dialled is not available.

00:18:23.703 --> 00:18:25.003
- Please leave a message... - She's not answering.

00:18:25.003 --> 00:18:26.063
She must be busy.

00:18:26.103 --> 00:18:27.333
Try again.

00:18:39.063 --> 00:18:41.263
- The number you have dialled... - Not picking up.

00:18:41.503 --> 00:18:43.903
Text Gyu Rim and tell her I'm awake...

00:18:44.473 --> 00:18:46.203
And not to worry.

00:18:46.763 --> 00:18:47.763
Okay.

00:18:48.503 --> 00:18:50.903
Jung Woo, could you give us a minute?

00:18:51.403 --> 00:18:52.903
- Okay. - Thanks.

00:18:59.603 --> 00:19:00.633
Are you okay?

00:19:01.633 --> 00:19:02.633
I'm okay.

00:19:03.303 --> 00:19:04.433
Sorry for scaring you.

00:19:06.003 --> 00:19:07.503
I have something to tell you.

00:19:08.433 --> 00:19:11.663
I thought about waiting until you're fully recovered,

00:19:12.973 --> 00:19:14.403
But I think it's better to tell you sooner.

00:19:14.703 --> 00:19:15.733
What is it?

00:19:15.903 --> 00:19:17.033
It's about Han Gyu Rim,

00:19:17.103 --> 00:19:18.903
The woman you gave up everything for.

00:19:20.233 --> 00:19:21.263
Did you see Gyu Rim?

00:19:21.473 --> 00:19:23.503
Gyu Rim called me and asked to meet.

00:19:32.403 --> 00:19:33.603
Just give me 100,000 dollars.

00:19:35.063 --> 00:19:36.133
100,000 dollars?

00:19:37.303 --> 00:19:39.503
100,000 dollars for leaving Mu Jin.

00:19:39.503 --> 00:19:41.303
That sounds like a pretty good deal, don't you think?

00:19:42.933 --> 00:19:45.233
(Seized Item)

00:19:45.473 --> 00:19:46.703
To be honest,

00:19:47.333 --> 00:19:49.203
When I heard Mu Jin was from a rich family,

00:19:49.903 --> 00:19:52.473
I was surprised, but a part of me was thrilled.

00:19:54.263 --> 00:19:55.333
I thought, "Am I going to be a Cinderella,"

00:19:55.403 --> 00:19:56.863
"just like in the movies?"

00:19:57.973 --> 00:20:00.763
"I won't have to struggle through this miserable life anymore."

00:20:01.803 --> 00:20:03.473
I was so happy. Truly.

00:20:04.663 --> 00:20:05.933
If things stay as they are,

00:20:06.533 --> 00:20:08.063
I'd have to take on all of Kim Mu Jin's burdens...

00:20:08.133 --> 00:20:10.103
Without any help from you.

00:20:10.633 --> 00:20:12.503
Honestly, I'm not confident I can do that.

00:20:12.503 --> 00:20:14.103
We only dated for one year.

00:20:14.803 --> 00:20:16.403
And we're not married.

00:20:16.863 --> 00:20:19.103
I'm having a hard enough time as it is.

00:20:19.503 --> 00:20:20.733
How am I supposed to know...

00:20:20.803 --> 00:20:21.833
How bad his disability from the crash will be?

00:20:21.833 --> 00:20:23.303
Why would I just take on all of that?

00:20:23.903 --> 00:20:26.133
I can't do it. I don't want to.

00:20:26.433 --> 00:20:27.473
Stop it.

00:20:32.763 --> 00:20:34.433
What did you do to Gyu Rim?

00:20:36.973 --> 00:20:39.933
What could I possibly have done to make Han Gyu Rim say all that?

00:20:48.473 --> 00:20:49.703
I want to be alone.

00:20:54.563 --> 00:20:56.933
Okay. Get some rest.

00:21:18.433 --> 00:21:19.473
Yes.

00:21:24.903 --> 00:21:26.403
Thank you for showing us.

00:21:27.233 --> 00:21:29.163
- Thank you. - Goodbye.

00:22:34.533 --> 00:22:35.563
One more time.

00:22:39.563 --> 00:22:40.563
One more time.

00:22:44.063 --> 00:22:45.433
- Are you okay? - Yes. Thanks.

00:23:04.333 --> 00:23:05.333
Thanks.

00:23:26.833 --> 00:23:27.833
Who is it?

00:23:34.003 --> 00:23:35.133
Is Gyu Rim here?

00:23:35.503 --> 00:23:36.503
Who?

00:23:38.003 --> 00:23:39.003
Han Gyu Rim.

00:23:39.803 --> 00:23:41.133
Didn't you just come out of this house?

00:23:41.633 --> 00:23:44.563
What? What's so strange about me coming out of my own house?

00:23:45.833 --> 00:23:47.633
Oh, you must have moved in.

00:23:48.463 --> 00:23:51.263
Then the people who lived here before...

00:23:51.903 --> 00:23:53.463
How should I know?

00:23:53.963 --> 00:23:56.903
Even after they got an eviction notice,

00:23:57.063 --> 00:23:59.963
They were such a pain and refused to leave.

00:24:13.503 --> 00:24:16.233
(Gyu Rim)

00:24:17.863 --> 00:24:20.433
The number you have dialled is not in service.

00:24:20.903 --> 00:24:23.133
Please check the number and try again.

00:25:11.403 --> 00:25:16.363
(8 years later)

00:25:16.663 --> 00:25:18.763
(Most Precious Thing In The World)

00:25:27.663 --> 00:25:28.663
It's a pouch, right?

00:25:30.933 --> 00:25:32.503
What's this? A puppy?

00:25:33.303 --> 00:25:35.633
- Is this Yun Hu's puppy? - Yes.

00:25:35.733 --> 00:25:38.303
- It's so cute. - Isn't it pretty?

00:25:38.303 --> 00:25:39.563
It's pretty.

00:25:43.563 --> 00:25:46.033
- Is this Jin Ju's teddy bear? - Yes.

00:25:46.033 --> 00:25:47.963
This must be the teddy bear you cherish the most.

00:25:48.033 --> 00:25:49.133
Five hearts.

00:25:54.233 --> 00:25:55.703
This is drawn so well.

00:25:56.063 --> 00:25:57.063
Who is this?

00:25:57.133 --> 00:25:58.333
Who is this person that our Gyeol thinks...

00:25:58.403 --> 00:25:59.863
Is the most precious in the world?

00:25:59.933 --> 00:26:01.303
It's my mom.

00:26:01.803 --> 00:26:04.503
Your mom must be so happy.

00:26:07.703 --> 00:26:11.833
But Gyeol, what's this dot?

00:26:12.603 --> 00:26:13.733
That's my dad.

00:26:15.433 --> 00:26:18.103
- That's your dad? - Yes.

00:26:18.633 --> 00:26:20.363
But he's still a precious dad, right?

00:26:20.433 --> 00:26:22.203
Seeing as you drew him in, even if it's just a dot.

00:26:22.463 --> 00:26:25.363
Well, he is the reason I was born.

00:26:25.563 --> 00:26:27.733
I think I'm grateful for just about that much.

00:26:28.603 --> 00:26:29.863
Oh, right.

00:26:32.363 --> 00:26:34.463
Mom.

00:26:37.833 --> 00:26:40.633
- Son, you're home? - Mom.

00:26:41.233 --> 00:26:43.633
So, how was school?

00:26:43.703 --> 00:26:45.833
- Was it fun? - Yes, it was fun.

00:26:45.833 --> 00:26:47.063
Mom, here.

00:26:47.503 --> 00:26:48.763
What's this?

00:26:51.763 --> 00:26:54.803
Gyeol, who is this pretty lady?

00:26:55.263 --> 00:26:56.333
It's you, Mom.

00:26:56.403 --> 00:26:59.333
My teacher told us to draw the most precious thing in the world.

00:27:00.703 --> 00:27:03.033
Am I the most precious person in the world to you?

00:27:03.103 --> 00:27:04.103
Yes.

00:27:04.403 --> 00:27:07.563
I'm representing my class in the drawing contest next week.

00:27:07.833 --> 00:27:10.363
Really? Gyeol, you're the best.

00:27:12.433 --> 00:27:14.203
You must be so happy, ma'am.

00:27:14.263 --> 00:27:15.733
You have a kind and pretty daughter-in-law,

00:27:15.803 --> 00:27:17.803
And a smart and cute grandson.

00:27:17.863 --> 00:27:19.763
Of course I am.

00:27:20.033 --> 00:27:21.763
It's absolutely wonderful.

00:27:22.103 --> 00:27:24.203
Why do you call me your grandson?

00:27:24.633 --> 00:27:27.103
And why is my mom your daughter-in-law?

00:27:27.163 --> 00:27:28.263
Why are you lying?

00:27:28.863 --> 00:27:31.433
I see your mom and you...

00:27:31.503 --> 00:27:34.833
As my own daughter-in-law and grandson. That's what I meant.

00:27:35.233 --> 00:27:38.303
Goodness, how can such a little thing be so prickly?

00:27:39.363 --> 00:27:42.463
- Take care. - Enjoy your food and come again.

00:27:42.903 --> 00:27:45.563
- Goodbye. - Hey.

00:27:46.133 --> 00:27:47.963
Hey, don't be like that, okay?

00:27:48.303 --> 00:27:52.603
We've known each other for ages, so why don't we really...

00:27:52.663 --> 00:27:54.403
Make your mom my daughter-in-law and you my grandson?

00:27:54.533 --> 00:27:55.533
No way.

00:27:57.303 --> 00:27:58.363
Han Gyeol.

00:27:58.363 --> 00:28:00.603
Are you going to keep being rude to her?

00:28:00.703 --> 00:28:05.503
But if she keeps lying, what if you can't get married?

00:28:05.563 --> 00:28:06.563
Goodness...

00:28:06.633 --> 00:28:08.003
Why wouldn't she be able to get married?

00:28:08.063 --> 00:28:10.403
My Heung Sik is right there waiting for her.

00:28:10.463 --> 00:28:12.563
Exactly. That's the problem.

00:28:12.633 --> 00:28:15.203
What? What in the world are you talking about?

00:28:15.433 --> 00:28:17.803
What's the problem with my son waiting for her?

00:28:17.863 --> 00:28:20.203
Okay, that's enough. Let's get back to work.

00:28:20.863 --> 00:28:23.163
You don't know what you're talking about, do you?

00:28:23.263 --> 00:28:24.633
In this whole wide world,

00:28:24.763 --> 00:28:27.203
There's no one like my son, you hear?

00:28:28.203 --> 00:28:30.533
I don't care. My mom's too good for him.

00:28:30.803 --> 00:28:33.403
Even if it were Kim Woo Bin, my mom would still be too good for him.

00:28:33.933 --> 00:28:35.733
What am I going to do with you?

00:28:35.803 --> 00:28:39.603
You know nothing, but you have such high standards.

00:28:44.233 --> 00:28:46.133
Gyeol, can you check my phone?

00:28:51.733 --> 00:28:53.733
(Gyu Young)

00:28:54.533 --> 00:28:55.533
It's Gyu Young.

00:28:55.633 --> 00:28:57.063
Can you answer it for me?

00:29:01.533 --> 00:29:04.403
Hey, you know that white dress I bought last month?

00:29:04.563 --> 00:29:08.603
The flowy, chiffon one. I need to wear it tomorrow,

00:29:08.663 --> 00:29:11.433
- take it to the dry cleaners now. - Is mom your secretary, Auntie?

00:29:11.603 --> 00:29:13.503
You should do your own errands, Auntie.

00:29:13.563 --> 00:29:15.503
Stop bossing my busy mom around.

00:29:17.103 --> 00:29:18.103
Hey.

00:29:20.433 --> 00:29:21.433
Gyeol.

00:29:22.433 --> 00:29:25.363
That's right. Good job, Gyeol.

00:29:25.933 --> 00:29:28.303
All that pent-up frustration I had,

00:29:28.363 --> 00:29:30.933
Just melted away.

00:29:31.733 --> 00:29:33.363
Your aunt, that little pest,

00:29:33.433 --> 00:29:35.463
Needs to be put in her place just like that.

00:29:36.203 --> 00:29:39.663
You did great. Smart boy.

00:29:44.133 --> 00:29:46.933
Darn it. That little brat.

00:29:54.563 --> 00:29:56.063
Hi, honey.

00:29:56.633 --> 00:30:00.303
No, I was planning to wear it to your cousin's wedding tomorrow,

00:30:00.303 --> 00:30:02.503
And I was going to ask my sister to get it dry-cleaned.

00:30:02.933 --> 00:30:04.663
But Han Gyeol, that little pipsqueak,

00:30:05.263 --> 00:30:07.733
Told me not to order his mom around...

00:30:11.363 --> 00:30:15.333
Really? No, I was just upset, that's all.

00:30:15.933 --> 00:30:17.733
Are you really going to buy me a new outfit?

00:30:18.403 --> 00:30:20.933
You're the best.

00:30:22.233 --> 00:30:23.533
Yes. Come in.

00:30:26.363 --> 00:30:29.163
It's time for Ms. Song Ji Young's appointment.

00:30:29.233 --> 00:30:30.233
Send her in, please.

00:30:30.603 --> 00:30:31.603
Okay.

00:30:33.903 --> 00:30:37.203
Honey, okay, I'll see you after work.

00:30:37.263 --> 00:30:38.433
Okay.

00:30:43.603 --> 00:30:45.203
(Dr. Han Gyu Young)

00:30:49.303 --> 00:30:50.833
What can I do for you today?

00:30:50.963 --> 00:30:52.333
Well, can I...

00:30:53.503 --> 00:30:55.833
Can I become Suzy?

00:30:57.133 --> 00:30:58.133
Excuse me?

00:30:58.363 --> 00:31:00.363
- Suzy? - Yes.

00:31:02.833 --> 00:31:05.963
That would be difficult, wouldn't it?

00:31:07.303 --> 00:31:08.633
Extremely difficult.

00:31:08.703 --> 00:31:10.203
Even if you were to die and be reborn,

00:31:10.263 --> 00:31:11.563
I don't think it would be possible.

00:31:14.703 --> 00:31:16.063
(Hospital Revenue: Incentives)

00:31:18.963 --> 00:31:22.963
Of course, it won't be easy, but nothing is impossible, right?

00:31:23.233 --> 00:31:26.303
Shall we find a solution together, step by step?

00:31:26.403 --> 00:31:27.433
Okay.

00:31:47.133 --> 00:31:49.333
Excuse me. Time to get up.

00:31:49.633 --> 00:31:51.533
It's after 3pm.

00:31:54.803 --> 00:31:56.733
If you were sleeping when I left for school,

00:31:57.033 --> 00:32:01.003
By the time I get home, shouldn't you at least be awake?

00:32:07.863 --> 00:32:09.863
How long are you planning to live like this?

00:32:10.633 --> 00:32:12.803
You're young with your whole life ahead of you.

00:32:12.903 --> 00:32:15.763
Don't you want to start living your life properly?

00:32:16.963 --> 00:32:18.933
You talk like an old man.

00:32:19.563 --> 00:32:21.663
You're just a kid. Why do you talk like that?

00:32:21.833 --> 00:32:23.003
Don't change the subject.

00:32:23.063 --> 00:32:24.763
Are you going to get your act together or not?

00:32:24.833 --> 00:32:26.533
Whether I get my act together or not,

00:32:26.603 --> 00:32:27.763
What's it to you?

00:32:27.833 --> 00:32:30.763
If you don't get your act together, it's hard on my mom.

00:32:31.563 --> 00:32:32.633
Well, look at the dutiful son.

00:32:32.733 --> 00:32:34.403
It's enough to make people without sons jealous.

00:32:40.403 --> 00:32:41.403
Hey, Han Gyeol.

00:32:41.733 --> 00:32:43.403
As I always tell you,

00:32:43.463 --> 00:32:45.563
My life is mine, and your life is yours.

00:32:46.003 --> 00:32:48.633
From now on, let's stay out of each other's lives.

00:32:49.633 --> 00:32:52.903
- Deal? - We're family, not strangers.

00:32:53.103 --> 00:32:54.733
How can you say that?

00:33:13.063 --> 00:33:15.803
Oh my goodness. Look at that cool expression.

00:33:15.863 --> 00:33:16.903
I can't handle it.

00:33:16.963 --> 00:33:18.133
I think I'm dying.

00:33:18.203 --> 00:33:20.703
If what I'm looking at isn't an angel, what is it?

00:33:20.763 --> 00:33:24.363
When Gyu Seo graduates next year, I might just drop out.

00:33:25.033 --> 00:33:28.103
There's no point in coming to school if Gyu Seo isn't here.

00:33:28.663 --> 00:33:30.403
- He's so handsome. - He's gorgeous.

00:33:30.403 --> 00:33:31.863
Can I have one of these?

00:33:32.933 --> 00:33:35.103
- Hey, I'll take one too. - Go ahead.

00:33:35.863 --> 00:33:37.533
Idol trainees are on another level.

00:33:37.533 --> 00:33:38.803
I know.

00:33:41.633 --> 00:33:43.933
This is giving me a serious inferiority complex.

00:33:44.333 --> 00:33:45.463
Are you sure it's relative?

00:33:45.633 --> 00:33:47.663
- And not absolute? - Time for soccer.

00:33:47.763 --> 00:33:48.863
We've got to play soccer during lunch.

00:33:48.933 --> 00:33:50.463
Hey, you know what?

00:33:50.833 --> 00:33:52.703
I heard his twin sister goes to our school too.

00:33:52.963 --> 00:33:55.203
If she's his twin, don't you think she'd be gorgeous?

00:33:55.303 --> 00:33:57.533
Oh, come on. You idiot.

00:33:57.833 --> 00:34:00.363
Hey, last year you kept saying you couldn't stand her,

00:34:00.433 --> 00:34:02.403
And you threw a fit to switch partners. Did you forget?

00:34:02.403 --> 00:34:04.503
Why would you bring her up now?

00:34:05.203 --> 00:34:06.503
You want to play? Want to join us?

00:34:06.903 --> 00:34:08.333
He and her... They're twins?

00:34:08.763 --> 00:34:09.763
We all have to stay strong.

00:34:12.033 --> 00:34:13.063
I've still got some food left.

00:34:13.263 --> 00:34:16.303
- Gyu Min. Han Gyu Min. - Wake up.

00:34:17.163 --> 00:34:20.203
Hey, please just set me up with Gyu Seo once.

00:34:20.433 --> 00:34:21.963
Oh, please.

00:34:23.203 --> 00:34:24.803
Hey, Gyu Min, you like tteokbokki, don't you?

00:34:24.963 --> 00:34:27.133
I know a killer place and it'll be my treat,

00:34:27.263 --> 00:34:28.503
So how about we go with Gyu Seo?

00:34:29.063 --> 00:34:31.303
Can't you just invite us over to your house once?

00:34:31.603 --> 00:34:32.703
When's your birthday?

00:34:32.963 --> 00:34:34.503
Oh, wait. Since you're twins with Gyu Seo,

00:34:34.563 --> 00:34:35.963
It's September 10, right?

00:34:38.533 --> 00:34:41.103
Look. I'm not close with Han Gyu Seo.

00:34:41.163 --> 00:34:43.003
If you want to see him, go ask him yourselves,

00:34:43.063 --> 00:34:44.503
And meet up with him.

00:34:45.063 --> 00:34:46.463
And take all of this back.

00:34:46.933 --> 00:34:48.433
- Hey, come on. - Gyu Min.

00:34:48.433 --> 00:34:50.603
Stop it. I'm going home.

00:34:51.063 --> 00:34:53.433
Hey, Han Gyu Min. Let's go home.

00:35:00.633 --> 00:35:02.763
Hey, where are you going?

00:35:05.563 --> 00:35:07.463
- Hey, Han Gyu Seo. - Hey, Su Min.

00:35:07.463 --> 00:35:10.033
- Thanks. I'm going home. - Bye.

00:35:10.033 --> 00:35:12.233
Hey, Han Gyu Min. Hey, wait up.

00:35:13.603 --> 00:35:14.873
Stay away from me, Han Gyu Seo.

00:35:15.633 --> 00:35:18.103
I'm begging you, please stop acting like we're close.

00:35:18.333 --> 00:35:20.933
Hey, how can I be acting?

00:35:21.733 --> 00:35:22.803
We just are close.

00:35:23.263 --> 00:35:24.263
Hey.

00:35:25.163 --> 00:35:27.033
Hey, we're family, and we're twins.

00:35:27.433 --> 00:35:29.663
Wouldn't it be weirder to pretend we're not close?

00:35:30.933 --> 00:35:33.333
Do you have any idea how much trouble you cause me?

00:35:33.433 --> 00:35:36.203
Because of you, I have no life of my own. None.

00:35:36.803 --> 00:35:37.933
I just...

00:35:38.133 --> 00:35:40.533
Want to fly under the radar and live quietly.

00:35:41.233 --> 00:35:43.303
Please, let's just pretend we're strangers,

00:35:43.373 --> 00:35:44.633
At least at school.

00:35:45.833 --> 00:35:48.133
All right, fine. I'm sorry.

00:35:50.403 --> 00:35:52.003
But, well...

00:35:53.303 --> 00:35:54.633
You're not sulking, are you?

00:36:01.533 --> 00:36:02.533
You scared me.

00:36:02.833 --> 00:36:04.503
Hey, you startled me.

00:36:05.333 --> 00:36:07.033
We're outside the school gates, so this doesn't count as school.

00:36:07.133 --> 00:36:08.703
I'll do what you said inside the school,

00:36:09.003 --> 00:36:11.003
So outside of school, I can do what I want, right?

00:36:12.433 --> 00:36:13.433
Time to act close.

00:36:14.373 --> 00:36:17.063
You know you're a real pain, right?

00:36:17.373 --> 00:36:18.703
I guess I can be.

00:36:20.933 --> 00:36:23.433
- Why are you taking my bag? - Carrying things stunts growth.

00:36:23.733 --> 00:36:24.733
My dear Gyu Min,

00:36:24.803 --> 00:36:26.303
You should grow every last centimetre you can.

00:36:28.263 --> 00:36:29.663
Hey, get back here. Give me my bag.

00:36:30.203 --> 00:36:31.433
Hey, give it back.

00:36:31.873 --> 00:36:32.873
My dear Gyu Min, grow up big and strong...

00:36:32.873 --> 00:36:34.133
And be in a beauty pageant.

00:36:34.133 --> 00:36:36.563
Hey. Then give me some of yours.

00:36:36.933 --> 00:36:37.933
Are you still mad?

00:36:38.903 --> 00:36:39.903
Want to get some tteokbokki?

00:36:40.033 --> 00:36:42.663
- It's my treat. - You go eat a lot.

00:36:42.733 --> 00:36:44.503
Do you know how bad tteokbokki is for losing weight?

00:36:45.333 --> 00:36:46.603
I thought you weren't on a diet.

00:36:47.333 --> 00:36:48.933
I mean, you were devouring jajangmyeon yesterday,

00:36:48.933 --> 00:36:50.533
So I thought you'd given up on your diet.

00:36:50.833 --> 00:36:51.933
I am on a diet.

00:36:52.403 --> 00:36:53.763
I'm just not losing any weight.

00:36:54.303 --> 00:36:55.933
You're the one who suggested jajangmyeon.

00:36:56.663 --> 00:36:58.233
Han Gyu Seo. Hey.

00:37:00.903 --> 00:37:01.903
Who are you?

00:37:02.633 --> 00:37:04.663
Why have you been following us around for days?

00:37:08.633 --> 00:37:09.633
Are you...

00:37:10.373 --> 00:37:11.703
The woman who abandoned us?

00:37:13.003 --> 00:37:14.003
The one who fell for another man...

00:37:14.063 --> 00:37:15.963
And ran off with all our money? Are you that gold digger?

00:37:20.333 --> 00:37:21.403
Tell me, ma'am.

00:37:22.963 --> 00:37:27.033
Oh, I'm sorry for following you.

00:37:27.533 --> 00:37:30.133
My daughter has a huge crush on you,

00:37:30.133 --> 00:37:31.763
And she's become lovesick.

00:37:32.263 --> 00:37:34.433
I wondered how handsome you must be...

00:37:34.633 --> 00:37:37.603
To make her sick, so I came to see for myself.

00:37:39.163 --> 00:37:41.803
So why are you so needlessly handsome, like a pop idol,

00:37:41.873 --> 00:37:44.263
Making me come back to see you?

00:37:44.873 --> 00:37:46.603
You should just make your debut.

00:37:46.833 --> 00:37:48.763
So I can watch you on TV at home.

00:37:49.803 --> 00:37:51.163
My arm hurts.

00:38:00.603 --> 00:38:01.603
Let's go.

00:38:05.203 --> 00:38:07.103
(No couples allowed.)

00:38:07.103 --> 00:38:08.533
(Dasolo welcomes solo diners, friends, and families.)

00:38:17.903 --> 00:38:19.233
All right, one T-bone for table three,

00:38:19.563 --> 00:38:21.563
- and one tomato pasta. - Yes, Chef.

00:38:22.033 --> 00:38:23.033
One T-bone.

00:38:25.663 --> 00:38:26.833
When was this made?

00:38:27.533 --> 00:38:28.663
An hour ago.

00:38:29.433 --> 00:38:30.433
Okay, it's fine.

00:38:35.463 --> 00:38:37.433
- Just more salt and pepper. - Yes, Chef.

00:38:41.263 --> 00:38:43.733
You'll break it apart like that. Fold it inward like this.

00:38:43.963 --> 00:38:44.963
Yes, Chef.

00:39:13.033 --> 00:39:16.203
Everyone, this place absolutely lives up to the hype.

00:39:16.263 --> 00:39:18.633
First of all, the taste is beyond words.

00:39:18.833 --> 00:39:20.933
The quality of every single ingredient is...

00:39:21.603 --> 00:39:23.633
Wow, can you see this?

00:39:23.903 --> 00:39:28.303
It's absolutely amazing. First, the vegetables.

00:39:28.373 --> 00:39:30.633
They're so incredibly crisp and fresh,

00:39:30.703 --> 00:39:32.033
It's like they were just picked.

00:39:32.103 --> 00:39:34.263
The meat's flavour, juiciness, and cook...

00:39:34.333 --> 00:39:35.903
Nothing is lacking.

00:39:35.903 --> 00:39:37.033
But...

00:39:37.633 --> 00:39:41.133
This place isn't just famous for its food, is it?

00:39:43.203 --> 00:39:44.233
Right.

00:39:44.303 --> 00:39:47.503
Is this really a couples' inferno and singles' paradise?

00:39:47.763 --> 00:39:48.763
Unmarried couples who don't show up...

00:39:48.833 --> 00:39:49.873
On a certificate of family relations,

00:39:50.133 --> 00:39:54.963
Male friends, female friends, man, man-man, woman-woman, anyway...

00:39:56.003 --> 00:39:58.633
Are all couples really banned from entering and dining?

00:39:59.003 --> 00:40:00.833
That's what I need to confirm now.

00:40:03.903 --> 00:40:05.503
At a glance,

00:40:06.063 --> 00:40:07.103
It looks normal.

00:40:08.233 --> 00:40:11.933
Is everyone family? Or are they married?

00:40:12.263 --> 00:40:13.263
Excuse me.

00:40:15.733 --> 00:40:16.803
Are you really married?

00:40:17.133 --> 00:40:18.533
Wait, aren't you high school students?

00:40:19.003 --> 00:40:22.233
We aren't students. We just look young for our age.

00:40:25.033 --> 00:40:26.033
Please show me your certificate.

00:40:26.703 --> 00:40:29.163
Oh, we forgot to bring it.

00:40:30.403 --> 00:40:32.033
You can access it on your phone these days.

00:40:32.103 --> 00:40:33.833
If you go to the Government24 website...

00:40:33.963 --> 00:40:35.803
What kind of restaurant asks customers...

00:40:35.873 --> 00:40:37.903
For their certificate of family relations?

00:40:38.603 --> 00:40:41.563
Are you even allowed to demand our personal information like this?

00:40:41.563 --> 00:40:43.003
That has always been the rule here.

00:40:43.533 --> 00:40:45.373
If you don't like it, you can go to another restaurant.

00:40:46.503 --> 00:40:49.203
I won't charge you for your meal, so please leave now.

00:40:50.733 --> 00:40:52.433
Honey, let's go.

00:40:53.003 --> 00:40:54.003
Fine, we'll leave.

00:41:01.163 --> 00:41:02.163
Could you please clear this table?

00:41:04.533 --> 00:41:06.433
Chef, we need to talk.

00:41:08.263 --> 00:41:09.263
Go ahead.

00:41:23.873 --> 00:41:24.873
Hey, you crazy...

00:41:25.933 --> 00:41:26.963
You're a psycho.

00:41:27.373 --> 00:41:29.403
Of all people, you had to pick a fight with a customer,

00:41:29.633 --> 00:41:31.563
And for such a ridiculous reason?

00:41:31.803 --> 00:41:32.803
Ridiculous reason?

00:41:33.563 --> 00:41:35.763
When we opened this place, you said it would be fun.

00:41:36.103 --> 00:41:37.563
What on earth is the problem?

00:41:40.703 --> 00:41:43.373
You not knowing what the problem is, is the problem.

00:41:44.333 --> 00:41:46.063
Why, because of your ridiculous, stubborn rule,

00:41:46.133 --> 00:41:49.503
Do perfectly fine couples have to sit at separate tables,

00:41:49.563 --> 00:41:53.003
Eating their meals wistfully like star-crossed lovers,

00:41:53.063 --> 00:41:55.603
And then reunite outside like they're long-lost family?

00:41:56.103 --> 00:41:58.803
Who do you think you are, tearing couples apart like this?

00:41:58.873 --> 00:42:00.803
What are you, the local relationship-wrecker?

00:42:02.003 --> 00:42:03.903
If they don't like it, they can eat somewhere else.

00:42:03.963 --> 00:42:05.333
Are you running a charity?

00:42:06.163 --> 00:42:09.263
Are you trying to keep all the other places in business?

00:42:09.803 --> 00:42:11.563
Because of you, since we opened,

00:42:12.033 --> 00:42:13.033
Do you know...

00:42:13.033 --> 00:42:15.603
We bombed on Valentine's Day, White Day, and Christmas?

00:42:16.963 --> 00:42:18.633
On the days that are peak season for everyone else,

00:42:18.703 --> 00:42:21.703
Why are you so determined to ruin things for me?

00:42:21.763 --> 00:42:23.003
This is all because of Han Gyu Rim...

00:42:28.133 --> 00:42:29.133
Are you two fighting again?

00:42:30.003 --> 00:42:33.303
Your combined age is nearly 70 now. Aren't you embarrassed?

00:42:33.633 --> 00:42:34.703
Seo Hyun, you're just in time.

00:42:36.033 --> 00:42:37.703
Listen to this and you be the judge.

00:42:38.373 --> 00:42:40.033
For a restaurant like this,

00:42:40.103 --> 00:42:42.003
To have a policy of not accepting couples...

00:42:42.103 --> 00:42:43.703
Does that make any sense?

00:42:46.833 --> 00:42:49.033
Well, I'm sure some customers get upset.

00:42:49.263 --> 00:42:51.003
But a lot of customers come here...

00:42:51.063 --> 00:42:53.033
Specifically because it's fun, right?

00:42:53.603 --> 00:42:55.533
Single people say this place is like a paradise for them.

00:42:55.603 --> 00:42:57.403
You even get their full support, don't you?

00:42:57.803 --> 00:42:59.133
Right, Jang Seo Hyun.

00:42:59.533 --> 00:43:02.563
You'd side with Kim Mu Jin even if he betrayed the country.

00:43:03.403 --> 00:43:05.403
I was an idiot to ask you.

00:43:05.733 --> 00:43:06.733
I'm heading out.

00:43:07.063 --> 00:43:08.733
We're not done talking. Where are you going?

00:43:10.303 --> 00:43:11.333
Honestly,

00:43:11.633 --> 00:43:14.903
I don't know why we have to argue about this to this extent.

00:43:15.733 --> 00:43:17.003
But if you're this stressed about it,

00:43:17.063 --> 00:43:18.403
I'll think about it again.

00:43:18.663 --> 00:43:19.903
Let's talk again tomorrow before we open.

00:43:20.133 --> 00:43:22.433
If we keep going like this, we'll just get emotional.

00:43:30.633 --> 00:43:31.663
Don't you get tired of it?

00:43:33.563 --> 00:43:34.563
Of what?

00:43:35.133 --> 00:43:39.033
Just staring at his back because he's not interested in you.

00:43:39.203 --> 00:43:40.903
Like this.

00:43:41.233 --> 00:43:42.963
I've seen it so much that I'm used to it now.

00:43:44.003 --> 00:43:45.733
You're not getting any younger.

00:43:45.963 --> 00:43:48.933
- How long are you going to... - I'll only do it until I'm 40.

00:43:49.633 --> 00:43:50.963
Do what until you're 40?

00:43:51.763 --> 00:43:53.533
I've liked him since I was ten years old.

00:43:53.733 --> 00:43:55.363
So 40 makes it 30 years, right?

00:43:56.633 --> 00:43:58.733
If he still doesn't love me by then, I'm planning to stop.

00:44:02.003 --> 00:44:04.233
You've found something else to tease me about, haven't you?

00:44:04.503 --> 00:44:06.533
On the day you complete 30 years of your one-sided love,

00:44:06.603 --> 00:44:08.203
Whether it works out or not,

00:44:08.503 --> 00:44:10.103
I'll give you a gold medal.

00:44:10.163 --> 00:44:13.333
30 Years of doing anything...

00:44:13.533 --> 00:44:16.863
Deserves that much praise and respect.

00:44:18.003 --> 00:44:19.933
If you're going to give me one, make it solid gold.

00:44:20.363 --> 00:44:22.203
Make the ribbon and the medal solid gold.

00:44:22.263 --> 00:44:24.503
A full 30 grams.

00:44:24.563 --> 00:44:25.763
Are you serious?

00:44:25.903 --> 00:44:27.733
Do you know how expensive gold is these days?

00:44:27.863 --> 00:44:28.863
Seriously...

00:44:33.033 --> 00:44:35.903
Jung Woo, I'm leaving. See you later.

00:44:40.733 --> 00:44:42.033
She's out of her mind.

00:44:43.463 --> 00:44:44.463
Mu Jin.

00:44:47.933 --> 00:44:48.933
Where are you going?

00:44:50.263 --> 00:44:52.203
Just out.

00:44:54.363 --> 00:44:55.933
Let's eat together next time.

00:44:56.003 --> 00:44:57.003
Where?

00:44:58.063 --> 00:44:59.203
Are you going to meet a woman?

00:44:59.633 --> 00:45:01.003
It's not like that.

00:45:01.403 --> 00:45:03.433
Then let's go together. I'll just go with you.

00:45:04.733 --> 00:45:05.733
Hey.

00:45:15.963 --> 00:45:16.963
All right.

00:45:19.963 --> 00:45:21.033
Got it.

00:45:28.003 --> 00:45:29.003
So close.

00:45:31.133 --> 00:45:32.533
- Enjoy it. - Thank you.

00:45:33.503 --> 00:45:34.763
Hey, you got a hot dog?

00:45:35.333 --> 00:45:36.433
Is one hot dog going to be enough for you?

00:45:38.133 --> 00:45:39.763
Eat that, finish what you need to do, and head home first.

00:45:40.033 --> 00:45:42.363
It's fine. I have an email to send anyway.

00:45:42.803 --> 00:45:44.463
Don't mind me. Do what you were doing.

00:45:44.463 --> 00:45:45.533
You sure?

00:45:46.033 --> 00:45:47.033
Okay.

00:45:50.003 --> 00:45:51.463
Time to play.

00:45:53.603 --> 00:45:55.533
(Tyrant Of Steel)

00:45:55.603 --> 00:45:56.963
Got him.

00:46:00.233 --> 00:46:02.733
- Okay. - How can someone change so much?

00:46:04.063 --> 00:46:05.833
Yes, I dodged it.

00:46:08.833 --> 00:46:10.503
I wonder if he really hit his head back then.

00:46:23.303 --> 00:46:25.263
That's it. I got it.

00:46:25.433 --> 00:46:27.133
This is tough.

00:46:27.703 --> 00:46:28.703
Darn it.

00:46:32.603 --> 00:46:34.803
Are you cursing because you got fourth place?

00:46:35.703 --> 00:46:38.563
- Darn it. - Why? What's wrong?

00:46:38.763 --> 00:46:42.063
This jerk kept getting in my way and using items to send me flying.

00:46:42.363 --> 00:46:43.363
What the heck?

00:46:44.033 --> 00:46:45.863
Look, this bastard did the same thing last time.

00:46:46.463 --> 00:46:47.863
Last time, when I'd almost defeated the boss,

00:46:47.933 --> 00:46:49.763
He swooped in, landed the final blow, and stole it.

00:46:49.863 --> 00:46:51.233
He took all the points and levelled up,

00:46:51.303 --> 00:46:52.303
And what did I get?

00:46:53.063 --> 00:46:55.263
Who plays a game with such terrible sportsmanship?

00:46:55.563 --> 00:46:57.363
Some jobless punk who's just cooped up at home.

00:46:58.803 --> 00:46:59.903
I'm so pissed.

00:47:01.203 --> 00:47:02.203
Hey, you.

00:47:03.203 --> 00:47:05.033
- What are you doing? - What?

00:47:05.303 --> 00:47:07.103
I mean, you kept messing with me.

00:47:07.403 --> 00:47:08.863
You did the same thing when I was fighting the boss.

00:47:09.103 --> 00:47:11.633
I didn't realise. I'm sorry. It was a mistake.

00:47:11.633 --> 00:47:13.433
(I didn't realise. I'm sorry. It was a mistake.)

00:47:13.433 --> 00:47:16.203
What? "You didn't realise"? "It was a mistake"?

00:47:16.833 --> 00:47:18.363
If you're making such mistakes without realising it,

00:47:18.433 --> 00:47:20.903
You must be a noob. Then stick to your own level.

00:47:21.363 --> 00:47:23.263
Let's not play like that, okay?

00:47:23.503 --> 00:47:26.903
Excuse me, I said it was a mistake and even apologised,

00:47:27.033 --> 00:47:28.363
But you're being way too harsh.

00:47:29.633 --> 00:47:30.633
Oh my...

00:47:31.703 --> 00:47:33.233
You don't think about what you've done,

00:47:33.303 --> 00:47:34.303
But you think my words are too harsh?

00:47:34.863 --> 00:47:36.403
After you maliciously and deliberately messed me up,

00:47:36.463 --> 00:47:38.163
You think saying, "I didn't know, it was a mistake" makes it all okay?

00:47:38.563 --> 00:47:40.963
I heard he turns into a complete child when he gets into a game,

00:47:40.963 --> 00:47:42.503
And Jung Woo was right.

00:47:43.033 --> 00:47:45.403
You can't just let guys like this get away with it.

00:47:49.363 --> 00:47:51.703
(It's just a game. Why are you taking it seriously...)

00:47:53.863 --> 00:47:55.063
Oh, come on. Why is he being like this?

00:47:55.803 --> 00:47:56.803
What is his problem?

00:47:56.863 --> 00:47:57.933
You want a piece of me?

00:48:00.403 --> 00:48:02.133
Why is he saying strange things?

00:48:02.763 --> 00:48:03.963
Gosh, seriously.

00:48:06.563 --> 00:48:07.633
Mom.

00:48:08.233 --> 00:48:09.363
Hey, who does this person think he is,

00:48:09.433 --> 00:48:12.103
Talking to my precious son and threatening him like that?

00:48:13.763 --> 00:48:14.803
Gyeol, move aside.

00:48:15.133 --> 00:48:16.303
- Move. - Hey.

00:48:16.403 --> 00:48:17.433
Move, move.

00:48:18.363 --> 00:48:21.263
Oh, for goodness' sake.

00:48:21.603 --> 00:48:24.433
Mom, a person like that is better off ignored.

00:48:24.633 --> 00:48:26.903
No, you have to shut these jerks down from the get-go.

00:48:26.903 --> 00:48:28.463
Why do you think they call them items?

00:48:28.603 --> 00:48:30.903
They're there for you to use. Why is he picking a fight...

00:48:30.963 --> 00:48:32.303
When he only lost because he's not good enough?

00:48:33.403 --> 00:48:36.163
What? Is this guy asking for a fight in real life?

00:48:36.363 --> 00:48:37.863
Don't tell him our address.

00:48:37.963 --> 00:48:40.303
What if he comes and tries to hurt us?

00:48:40.303 --> 00:48:42.063
Guys like this are just pathetic cowards.

00:48:42.063 --> 00:48:43.503
Tell them to show up, and they won't even dare.

00:48:43.563 --> 00:48:45.233
They just act tough online.

00:48:45.533 --> 00:48:48.403
Still, what if he actually shows up?

00:48:48.503 --> 00:48:50.803
Don't you worry. Mom is here for you.

00:48:51.103 --> 00:48:53.963
I'll protect you no matter what, so don't you worry about a thing.

00:48:54.503 --> 00:48:57.863
He sounds like a little kid. What does he think he's doing?

00:48:58.103 --> 00:48:59.233
What school does he go to?

00:48:59.303 --> 00:49:00.603
(What are you going to do if I don't back down?)

00:49:00.603 --> 00:49:03.503
Oh, you little brat. You've really asked for it now.

00:49:03.633 --> 00:49:05.003
Let's settle this today.

00:49:08.233 --> 00:49:10.033
See? You shouldn't have come, right?

00:49:10.363 --> 00:49:12.063
No. It was fun.

00:49:12.233 --> 00:49:13.803
Where else could I see a show like this for free?

00:49:14.263 --> 00:49:16.933
I saw a side of you today I never saw when you were 12.

00:49:17.533 --> 00:49:19.563
You were so cute and relatable.

00:49:20.603 --> 00:49:22.603
- Go on inside. - Wait a second.

00:49:26.803 --> 00:49:29.863
Hi, Mom. I'm right outside. Is there any food?

00:49:30.863 --> 00:49:32.503
Yes, okay. I'll be right in.

00:49:34.403 --> 00:49:35.903
You came all this way. Stay and eat.

00:49:36.303 --> 00:49:38.003
You like my mom's cooking, don't you?

00:49:39.163 --> 00:49:41.203
What did he do to deserve a meal?

00:49:41.663 --> 00:49:43.703
- Chairman, hello. - Dad.

00:49:45.803 --> 00:49:47.403
What? Am I wrong?

00:49:48.763 --> 00:49:50.533
He's always treating my daughter like dirt.

00:49:50.763 --> 00:49:53.363
Why would I feed him a warm meal? Right?

00:49:54.033 --> 00:49:56.163
Why are you being like this?

00:49:57.133 --> 00:49:59.933
Hey, why are you sending such mixed signals?

00:50:01.233 --> 00:50:02.403
Why did you give her a ride?

00:50:02.663 --> 00:50:04.733
And why would you agree to eat food from my wife?

00:50:06.433 --> 00:50:08.333
No, it's not like that, Dad.

00:50:08.403 --> 00:50:10.463
Hold on. Let him speak for himself.

00:50:11.033 --> 00:50:12.033
I'm sorry, Chairman,

00:50:12.033 --> 00:50:13.863
But I've never given Seo Hyun mixed signals.

00:50:14.803 --> 00:50:15.803
Oh, really?

00:50:16.263 --> 00:50:17.263
You weren't confused?

00:50:17.263 --> 00:50:19.803
He's right. I asked him to give me a ride.

00:50:19.863 --> 00:50:23.233
And as a thank-you, I invited him to stay for dinner.

00:50:23.403 --> 00:50:25.033
Dad, you don't even know what you're talking about.

00:50:26.833 --> 00:50:28.403
This whole situation just makes me angrier.

00:50:28.863 --> 00:50:30.003
It's not like you're lacking anything,

00:50:30.003 --> 00:50:31.333
So why are you so hung up on a guy like this?

00:50:32.363 --> 00:50:33.963
Hey. And what makes you so great?

00:50:34.063 --> 00:50:35.333
Is my Seo Hyun not good enough for you?

00:50:35.803 --> 00:50:38.363
No, sir. Absolutely not. That's not it at all.

00:50:38.463 --> 00:50:39.633
- That's not it, right? - That's right.

00:50:39.633 --> 00:50:41.063
You didn't give her mixed signals,

00:50:41.063 --> 00:50:43.003
And Seo Hyun isn't lacking anything. This is your problem.

00:50:44.003 --> 00:50:45.403
Dad.

00:50:46.603 --> 00:50:48.463
You're so frustrating.

00:50:49.863 --> 00:50:52.763
You need to send some mixed signals sometimes.

00:50:53.203 --> 00:50:56.233
If she pushes, you let yourself get pushed a little,

00:50:56.303 --> 00:50:58.103
And then you have to pull her in. You get it?

00:50:58.103 --> 00:50:59.803
What are you, Fort Knox?

00:51:00.163 --> 00:51:03.003
You're just so buttoned up and rigid.

00:51:03.063 --> 00:51:05.563
Come on. This is so frustrating.

00:51:06.333 --> 00:51:07.933
- There's no food. Get going. - Yes, sir.

00:51:07.933 --> 00:51:09.433
- You, come inside. - Dad.

00:51:09.433 --> 00:51:10.663
I'll be in touch.

00:51:11.403 --> 00:51:12.403
Good night.

00:51:12.703 --> 00:51:14.603
- Mu Jin. - Go.

00:51:17.403 --> 00:51:18.603
Just get in the elevator. Hurry.

00:51:46.103 --> 00:51:47.103
Honey.

00:51:47.763 --> 00:51:48.763
Do you like it?

00:51:49.603 --> 00:51:50.603
Yes.

00:51:52.103 --> 00:51:54.133
Marry me, Gyu Young.

00:51:55.633 --> 00:51:56.633
Married?

00:51:57.903 --> 00:51:58.903
I'll...

00:52:02.263 --> 00:52:04.333
I'll give you the stars and the moon.

00:52:05.003 --> 00:52:06.533
I'll make you so happy.

00:52:08.303 --> 00:52:10.663
Marry me. Please.

00:52:19.703 --> 00:52:21.263
Will you marry me?

00:52:24.863 --> 00:52:25.863
Yes.

00:52:33.663 --> 00:52:34.803
It's beautiful.

00:52:40.803 --> 00:52:41.803
I love you.

00:52:42.763 --> 00:52:43.903
I love you too.

00:52:46.133 --> 00:52:47.463
Looks so good on you.

00:52:59.963 --> 00:53:01.503
It's so beautiful. Does it look good on me?

00:53:01.833 --> 00:53:03.203
Must be nice.

00:53:03.633 --> 00:53:05.433
I remember when I was like that.

00:53:08.633 --> 00:53:10.203
Good and beautiful things...

00:53:10.403 --> 00:53:12.303
Seem to disappear so quickly.

00:53:16.103 --> 00:53:17.163
They haven't disappeared.

00:53:19.133 --> 00:53:20.703
You still have all of those things.

00:53:21.803 --> 00:53:23.163
Right here,

00:53:24.403 --> 00:53:25.403
Right here,

00:53:26.703 --> 00:53:27.703
And right here.

00:53:28.963 --> 00:53:30.633
Stop.

00:53:40.103 --> 00:53:41.933
Why is it suddenly so hot in here?

00:53:43.333 --> 00:53:44.763
Should we head up now?

00:53:45.303 --> 00:53:46.863
I'd like to get some rest.

00:53:48.603 --> 00:53:49.703
Let me just finish this drink.

00:53:50.203 --> 00:53:51.203
Cheers.

00:53:55.863 --> 00:53:56.863
Oh, no.

00:53:56.963 --> 00:53:58.063
Honey, are you okay?

00:53:58.603 --> 00:54:00.233
I'm going to the restroom.

00:54:00.703 --> 00:54:02.263
- Wait here. - Okay.

00:54:04.633 --> 00:54:06.303
When did you get this?

00:54:09.303 --> 00:54:10.303
Does it look good on me?

00:54:17.133 --> 00:54:18.303
Even if I'm being generous,

00:54:18.333 --> 00:54:20.333
She looks like she could be 12 years older than you.

00:54:21.103 --> 00:54:22.263
I don't know how you do it.

00:54:28.403 --> 00:54:29.403
None of your business.

00:54:31.303 --> 00:54:32.733
Looked like you were getting a ring.

00:54:32.803 --> 00:54:34.063
You're not actually going to marry him, are you?

00:54:34.633 --> 00:54:35.663
None of your business.

00:54:36.563 --> 00:54:37.803
And what if I do?

00:54:39.603 --> 00:54:41.533
Did the diamond blind you?

00:54:43.033 --> 00:54:44.633
You think this is the first time I've gotten one of these?

00:54:47.033 --> 00:54:48.233
Are you really going to marry him?

00:54:48.503 --> 00:54:50.303
I'm seriously considering it.

00:54:51.203 --> 00:54:54.463
His looks are decent enough, and his education isn't bad.

00:54:54.933 --> 00:54:57.903
Most importantly, he's incredibly rich.

00:54:59.363 --> 00:55:00.503
Does his character not matter to you?

00:55:00.933 --> 00:55:03.333
He's rich enough that his character doesn't matter.

00:55:03.463 --> 00:55:04.463
Happy now?

00:55:07.933 --> 00:55:09.103
Have you saved any money?

00:55:10.003 --> 00:55:12.833
I know a host who already bought an apartment.

00:55:19.033 --> 00:55:20.263
Is that what you were trying to say?

00:55:21.263 --> 00:55:22.663
Easy come, easy go.

00:55:22.903 --> 00:55:25.063
Don't spend it as fast as you make it.

00:55:25.163 --> 00:55:26.733
Buy a studio apartment or something.

00:55:26.803 --> 00:55:28.933
You're the first person to find out about my job.

00:55:31.363 --> 00:55:32.733
Is that what you wanted to say?

00:55:36.763 --> 00:55:37.933
How am I supposed to react, then?

00:55:38.633 --> 00:55:39.763
Should I ask, "Out of all the jobs in the world,"

00:55:39.763 --> 00:55:40.763
"why did you become a gigolo?"

00:55:40.863 --> 00:55:42.563
Should I be shocked and pass out?

00:55:43.133 --> 00:55:44.433
Am I Han Gyu Rim?

00:55:48.233 --> 00:55:49.233
Forget it.

00:55:50.003 --> 00:55:51.203
I was an idiot for even asking.

00:55:58.803 --> 00:55:59.833
That little brat.

00:56:01.133 --> 00:56:02.833
Of all the jobs...

00:56:04.903 --> 00:56:05.903
Whatever.

00:56:06.563 --> 00:56:08.063
It's your life, not mine.

00:56:16.903 --> 00:56:17.903
Mom.

00:56:18.303 --> 00:56:19.303
Yes?

00:56:20.233 --> 00:56:23.003
What was Dad like?

00:56:29.633 --> 00:56:30.803
Why are you asking all of a sudden?

00:56:32.033 --> 00:56:36.063
I was just wondering. My teacher asked about my dad today,

00:56:36.533 --> 00:56:37.863
And I didn't know anything about him.

00:56:40.133 --> 00:56:41.263
To be honest,

00:56:41.603 --> 00:56:43.503
I never really cared before.

00:56:45.863 --> 00:56:47.763
And I probably won't care in the future, either.

00:56:49.663 --> 00:56:52.603
You don't have to tell me if you don't want to.

00:56:53.463 --> 00:56:55.433
I'm not dying to know or anything.

00:56:58.203 --> 00:57:01.333
He's your dad, so, of course, he was a good person.

00:57:02.563 --> 00:57:03.663
And?

00:57:04.263 --> 00:57:06.533
Was he handsome? Was he tall?

00:57:06.533 --> 00:57:07.733
Did he look like me?

00:57:08.703 --> 00:57:10.433
He was handsome and tall.

00:57:11.133 --> 00:57:13.133
Let's see if you look like him.

00:57:17.663 --> 00:57:18.663
You do look like him.

00:57:22.563 --> 00:57:24.303
Is he still alive?

00:57:26.033 --> 00:57:27.163
Yes.

00:57:27.633 --> 00:57:29.063
Then,

00:57:29.933 --> 00:57:31.333
Don't you miss him?

00:57:33.103 --> 00:57:35.063
Do you miss him?

00:57:40.303 --> 00:57:41.303
No.

00:57:44.933 --> 00:57:47.603
All I need is you.

00:58:09.803 --> 00:58:11.263
(Geumje Police Station)

00:58:11.333 --> 00:58:13.403
I wasn't in my right mind due to stress.

00:58:14.303 --> 00:58:16.733
I believe I was overly emotional.

00:58:17.603 --> 00:58:19.603
I am sincerely reflecting on my actions.

00:58:22.533 --> 00:58:23.663
Do you think that'll be enough?

00:58:26.703 --> 00:58:27.703
Unbelievable.

00:58:30.563 --> 00:58:32.963
What on earth did you say during a game...

00:58:33.163 --> 00:58:35.163
That got you reported and brought in for questioning?

00:58:37.333 --> 00:58:38.663
From what I've seen,

00:58:38.733 --> 00:58:40.403
These things rarely become a formal investigation.

00:58:40.763 --> 00:58:44.333
- Just how bad was it? - Hey, I'm a victim here too.

00:58:45.203 --> 00:58:46.863
I was staring at the monitor and crying...

00:58:47.033 --> 00:58:50.363
No, I was bleeding from my eyes from all the abuse I took.

00:58:50.663 --> 00:58:54.533
Oh, well done. You trade insults,

00:58:54.603 --> 00:58:56.933
And then you both come in for questioning.

00:58:57.633 --> 00:58:59.603
You two are practically soulmates.

00:58:59.963 --> 00:59:00.963
I wonder how old they are.

00:59:01.033 --> 00:59:03.903
Who cares how old your soulmate is?

00:59:04.003 --> 00:59:05.903
Just say you've got some mental problems...

00:59:05.963 --> 00:59:07.533
And ask them to cut you a break.

00:59:07.733 --> 00:59:09.033
Try to settle this amicably.

00:59:12.003 --> 00:59:13.433
Darn it.

00:59:14.403 --> 00:59:16.703
What? You want me to go with you as a lawyer?

00:59:17.103 --> 00:59:18.263
No, it's fine.

00:59:19.163 --> 00:59:20.303
I'll be back.

00:59:23.433 --> 00:59:26.733
(Geumje Police Station)

00:59:26.803 --> 00:59:28.233
Does he think he's Benjamin Button?

00:59:30.103 --> 00:59:31.463
This is beyond regression.

00:59:32.133 --> 00:59:33.833
How can he get more immature with age?

00:59:34.003 --> 00:59:35.103
"I'll be back?" What's that supposed to mean?

00:59:35.203 --> 00:59:36.403
I hope he doesn't come back.

00:59:37.233 --> 00:59:38.233
Darn it.

00:59:38.303 --> 00:59:40.303
(Police)

00:59:40.803 --> 00:59:42.203
Let go of me.

01:01:00.663 --> 01:01:01.663
Are you Kim Mu Jin?

01:01:03.203 --> 01:01:04.203
Yes.

01:01:05.303 --> 01:01:07.963
So, you must be Han Gyeol's...

01:01:09.163 --> 01:01:10.163
Guardian?

01:01:12.833 --> 01:01:14.803
The account does belong to Han Gyeol,

01:01:15.763 --> 01:01:17.403
But I'm the one who wrote the comments.

01:01:19.563 --> 01:01:21.133
You two should know better.

01:01:22.103 --> 01:01:23.333
Please have a seat, both of you.

01:01:31.203 --> 01:01:32.963
"You stupid son of a gun."

01:01:33.603 --> 01:01:34.603
"Looking at what you're doing,"

01:01:34.663 --> 01:01:37.203
"I feel so sorry for the mother who gave birth to you."

01:01:37.803 --> 01:01:39.433
"She suffered for ten months..."

01:01:39.633 --> 01:01:40.963
"just to give birth to a piece of garbage."

01:01:41.203 --> 01:01:42.233
Han Gyu Rim.

01:01:42.833 --> 01:01:44.233
Is this what you actually wrote?

01:01:46.563 --> 01:01:47.563
Yes.

01:01:49.403 --> 01:01:50.663
So, Kim Mu Jin.

01:01:51.203 --> 01:01:53.133
"What the frickin' heck?"

01:01:53.563 --> 01:01:56.263
"Instead of worrying about my mom, you should worry about yours."

01:01:56.433 --> 01:01:57.803
"Is she even still alive?"

01:01:58.303 --> 01:02:00.203
"Didn't she die of embarrassment already?"

01:02:00.563 --> 01:02:01.633
This is what you wrote, right?

01:02:02.563 --> 01:02:04.963
- Yes. - What was your intention?

01:02:05.303 --> 01:02:06.663
State your cases one at a time.

01:02:08.703 --> 01:02:10.663
I Didn't have some grand intention.

01:02:10.663 --> 01:02:11.803
In the heat of the moment,

01:02:12.463 --> 01:02:13.903
I got carried away.

01:02:14.603 --> 01:02:17.063
Neither of you wants to press charges against each other, right?

01:02:17.833 --> 01:02:18.833
That's right.

01:02:19.863 --> 01:02:20.863
That's right.

01:02:20.933 --> 01:02:22.303
Since this is a first offence for both of you,

01:02:23.063 --> 01:02:25.563
And you both seem remorseful, how about you settle this...

01:02:25.633 --> 01:02:28.133
By writing and exchanging apologies?

01:02:28.603 --> 01:02:30.933
If you get reported for trading insults again,

01:02:30.933 --> 01:02:32.603
It won't end this easily next time.

01:02:33.203 --> 01:02:35.263
- Understood. - Understood.

01:02:35.333 --> 01:02:36.463
Let me see.

01:02:37.333 --> 01:02:40.133
This isn't a good spot. Both of you, follow me.

01:02:49.733 --> 01:02:52.003
Let me know when you're done writing your apologies.

01:03:08.033 --> 01:03:09.033
Look...

01:03:09.103 --> 01:03:10.203
Let's just hurry up and write apologies...

01:03:10.203 --> 01:03:11.263
So we can get out of here.

01:03:48.563 --> 01:03:50.563
(Geumje Police Station)

01:04:01.233 --> 01:04:02.263
Are you going to run away again?

01:04:06.633 --> 01:04:08.233
If you're running away, do it right.

01:04:09.003 --> 01:04:10.563
So we never have to see each other again.

01:04:18.803 --> 01:04:20.163
Mom.

01:04:21.263 --> 01:04:22.533
My son.

01:04:26.803 --> 01:04:29.233
Mom, you had a hard time, didn't you?

01:04:30.403 --> 01:04:31.503
Gyeol kept insisting...

01:04:31.503 --> 01:04:33.603
That he wanted to see you, so I brought him.

01:04:34.063 --> 01:04:35.403
Is everything settled?

01:04:37.633 --> 01:04:38.903
Here, eat this.

01:04:40.303 --> 01:04:42.133
You shouldn't have.

01:05:14.003 --> 01:05:15.703
(Love on the Menu)

01:05:15.763 --> 01:05:17.563
Honey, let's go.

01:05:17.763 --> 01:05:19.433
So that guy's her husband?

01:05:19.433 --> 01:05:20.763
She already got married?

01:05:20.833 --> 01:05:23.103
- Does he want to start over? - Hey.

01:05:23.163 --> 01:05:24.733
So you do still like him.

01:05:24.803 --> 01:05:28.003
- You're clearly not over him. - She has a son?

01:05:28.003 --> 01:05:29.903
I think they said he's eight years old.

01:05:29.963 --> 01:05:32.003
Han Gyu Rim and Mu Jin broke up eight years ago.

01:05:32.003 --> 01:05:33.363
Chairman, if you would just...

01:05:33.463 --> 01:05:36.303
I mean, if you would just pretend to be my father twice.

01:05:36.303 --> 01:05:37.763
Let's go buy some clothes at the department store.

01:05:37.763 --> 01:05:39.333
Clothes? Why all of a sudden?

01:05:39.433 --> 01:05:41.103
You need them for the family meeting.

01:05:41.103 --> 01:05:42.863
Who's having a family meeting?

01:05:42.933 --> 01:05:45.333
- Gyu Young is. - What?

